message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Closing costs by U.S. state, 2026"
authors:
  - name: "Broker & Agent Solutions"
    website: "https://brokerandagent.com"
abstract: "Seller and buyer closing costs in all 50 states and the District of Columbia on a $400,000 home and at each state’s median home value: title insurance where each side usually pays for it, settlement, recording and attorney fees, lender charges, and the state and local taxes each side usually pays. State-set costs come from statutes and agencies; other fees are national estimates, stated in the methodology."
